```text
grep -nH "runtime token issued\|IssueLocalTokenFile\|token_file\|Token\|HelloAck\|Validate(runtimeID\|runtime authentication failed\|RuntimeTokenPath\|WriteTokenFile" cmd/tabula/main.go cmd/tabula/local_runtime.go cmd/tabula-runtime/config/config.go cmd/tabula-runtime/dialer/dialer.go internal/kernel/runtime_attach.go internal/runtime/auth/token.go
```

