- `cmd/tabula/main.go:294` — log line records runtime id only
- `cmd/tabula/local_runtime.go:37` — generated runtime config references `runtime-token` path
- `cmd/tabula-runtime/dialer/dialer.go:76-89` — token read and authenticated Hello handshake
- `internal/kernel/runtime_attach.go:43` — `HelloAck` gate before runtime registration
- `internal/runtime/auth/token.go:99` — constant-time token comparison
