- `internal/runtime/auth/token.go:170-199` — `runtime-token` file permissions hardened to `0700`/`0600`

## Execution / validation evidence

Command:

```text
grep -nH "exec\.Command\|exec\.CommandContext\|filepath\.Join\(req\.WorkingDir, entry\)\|ReplyMode\|Channel != \"bus\"\|type is required\|sanitizeProtocolError\|strings\.Contains\(msg, \"token\"\)" cmd/tabula/local_runtime.go cmd/tabula-runtime/policy/bare/bare.go internal/kernel/runtime_async.go internal/runtime/conn/conn.go
```

Key matches:

- `cmd/tabula/local_runtime.go:113` — managed runtime uses `exec.Command(...)`, not a shell
